        {
          "id": "e7ce48e6-38e6-49f6-aca6-e663d250e5ab",
          "name": "Get Meeting",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Meeting",
            "description": {
              "content": "[operation: meeting-get]\n\n\n\nREAD-ONLY\n\n\n\nFetches full record for a single meeting by meetingId.\n\n- meetingId (req): UUID\n\n→ meeting object (payload structure may change); key fields: meetingStatus (not \"status\"), activities (array including a ScheduledAt entry — no top-level scheduledAt), id (not \"meetingId\"); no top-level linkedCrmEventIds\n\nsee: meeting-list (find meetingId by time range), meeting-cancel/noshow (change status), meeting-activity (admin URL), crm-get (if CRM ID known)",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "org",
                "meetings",
                "get",
                ":meetingId"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{v1-org-meetings-get-meetingId-Url}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<uuid>",
                  "key": "meetingId",
                  "description": "(Required) Meeting Id"
